---
title: Retry policy
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client; participant Server
    rect rgb(230,240,250)
        loop Retry
            alt Connected
                opt Has credentials
                    Client->>Server: Request #59; poll
                end
            else Offline
                break Cancelled
                    Server-->>Client: Stop
                end
            end
        end
    end
    par Notify
        Server-)Client: Notify
    and Audit
        par_over Persist
            Server->>Server: Write
        and Trace
            Server->>Server: Trace
        end
    end
    critical Commit
        Client->>Server: Save
    option Timeout
        Client->>Server: Roll back
    end
